 "cards": {
  "12833": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_scroll_03.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12833\">Plans: Hammer of the Titans</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 63</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Blacksmithing (300)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Master Hammersmith</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__use\">Use: Teaches you how to make a Hammer of the Titans.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Hammer of the Titans</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 63</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when equipped</span><span class=\"wf-item__row\"><span>Two-Hand</span><span>Mace</span></span><span class=\"wf-item__row\"><span>163 - 246 Damage</span><span>Speed 3.80</span></span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">(53.82 damage per second)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+15 Strength</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Durability 100 / 100</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 58</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__use\">Chance on hit: Stuns target for 3 sec.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Thorium Bar (50), Arcanite Bar (15), Guardian Stone (4), Enchanted Leather (6), Essence of Earth (10)</span></div></div>",
  "13340": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_misc_cape_20.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13340\">Cape of the Black Baron</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 63</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when picked up</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Back</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">45 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+15 Agility</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 58</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__use\">Equip: +20 Attack Power.</span></div></div>",
  "13397": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_misc_cape_19.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=13397\">Stoneskin Gargoyle Cape</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 61</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when picked up</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Back</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">43 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+7 Strength</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+8 Agility</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+14 Stamina</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+50 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 56</span></div></div>",
  "16675": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_boots_plate_07.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=16675\">Beaststalker's Boots</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 59</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when picked up</span><span class=\"wf-item__row\"><span>Feet</span><span>Mail</span></span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">240 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+21 Agility</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+9 Stamina</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+3 Intellect</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Durability 60 / 60</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 54</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__setname\">Beaststalker Armor (0/8)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(3) Set: +30 Attack Power.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(4) Set: When struck in combat, has a 8% chance to remove a Root effect from yourself. Can only occur once every 60 sec. (Proc chance: 8%, 1m cooldown)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(5) Set: Your melee and ranged autoattacks have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana. (Proc chance: 5%)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec.</span></div></div>",
  "16678": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_pants_03.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=16678\">Beaststalker's Pants</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 61</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when picked up</span><span class=\"wf-item__row\"><span>Legs</span><span>Mail</span></span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">315 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+6 Strength</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+26 Agility</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+6 Stamina</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+10 Intellect</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+12 Spirit</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Durability 90 / 90</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 56</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__setname\">Beaststalker Armor (0/8)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(3) Set: +30 Attack Power.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(4) Set: When struck in combat, has a 8% chance to remove a Root effect from yourself. Can only occur once every 60 sec. (Proc chance: 8%, 1m cooldown)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(5) Set: Your melee and ranged autoattacks have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana. (Proc chance: 5%)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec.</span></div></div>",
  "16687": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_pants_06.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=16687\">Magister's Leggings</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 61</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when picked up</span><span class=\"wf-item__row\"><span>Legs</span><span>Cloth</span></span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">76 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+12 Stamina</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+15 Intellect</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+21 Spirit</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Durability 65 / 65</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 56</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__use\">Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 0.9%.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__use\">Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 7.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__setname\">Magister's Regalia (0/8)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of freezing the attacker in place for 3 sec. Can only occur once every 60 sec. (Proc chance: 2%, 1m cooldown)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana. (Proc chance: 5%)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec.</span></div></div>",
  "16691": "<div class=\"wf-item\"><img class=\"wf-item__icon\" src=\"/wh/inv_boots_05.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"wf-item__tip\"><a class=\"wf-item__name wf-q3\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=16691\">Devout Sandals</a><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__meta\">Item Level 59</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Binds when picked up</span><span class=\"wf-item__row\"><span>Feet</span><span>Cloth</span></span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">58 Armor</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+9 Stamina</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+10 Intellect</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">+17 Spirit</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Durability 40 / 40</span><span class=\"wf-item__line\">Requires Level 54</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__use\">Equip: Increases healing done by up to 11 and damage done by up to 4 for all magical spells and effects.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__setname\">Vestments of the Devout (0/8)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(2) Set: +8 All Resistances.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(3) Set: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to 18.</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(4) Set: When struck in combat has a 2% chance of shielding the wearer in a protective shield which will absorb 488 damage. Can only occur once every 60 sec. (Proc chance: 2%, 1m cooldown)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(5) Set: Your spellcasts have a 5% chance to energize you for 200 mana. (Proc chance: 5%)</span><span class=\"wf-item__line wf-item__set\">(6) Set: Restores 8 mana per 5 sec.</span></div></div>",
